I log in and open the profile section.
There is a digital form on the screen.
I slowly fill out the details one by one.
An official identity document is required here.
I take my work visa from the bag.
I place it on the table and take a clear photo.
Then I upload that photo to the website.
I look at the screen again.
The upload bar is moving very slowly.
In January, such things were a big difficulty for me.
But now, I usually finish these things quickly.
I now know how to use such websites easily.
Finally, the photo is successfully uploaded.
Then I go to the next part of the form.
